# OpenOCD through the jtag_probe lane: reset and the chain's IDCODE (examine), reset and
# the IR capture check (OpenOCD shifts more bits than the 4-bit IR), then the script's IR
# and DR scans: IDCODE (0xE) read by DR scan, and 0xA5 through BYPASS (0xF), one bit later.
RESET
IDCODE 4BA00477
RESET
IR 6 TDI=3F TDO=31
IR 4 TDI=E TDO=1
DR 32 TDI=00000000 TDO=4BA00477
IR 4 TDI=F TDO=1
DR 9 TDI=0A5 TDO=14A
